00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.630
Episode 63

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.630
The Space Stronghold, Metal Plant

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:50.290
I found a Chaos Emerald.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:51.920
In fact, two of them!

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:56.720
We currently have two, and Sonic has three. That means...

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:01.050
We now have all seven!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.100
That's right.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.020
Then hurry up and get them.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.850
What do you mean?

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:11.440
Don't play dumb with me.

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:18.530
I hate you, Rouge. I hope Dr. Eggman doesn't find out.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:21.530
I wasn't playing dumb.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:28.040
Umm... I'm just getting old.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:32.580
I'm more forgetful these days.

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:35.380
So where are they?

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:53.610
In there.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:58.280
It's humongous! It's as large as the moon!

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.570
Size isn't the issue.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.570
That's definitely a Metarex fortress.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:05.200
That means it has a defense system.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:06.700
Let's see.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:23.970
The defense system is perfect.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.600
Yeah, so what are you going to do?

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:30.140
What am I going to do? I'm going to give up.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.230
You must be kidding!

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:34.980
You're giving up when the treasure is right before your eyes?

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:39.530
You have an I.Q. of 300! Think of something!

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:45.990
I know you're trying to get the better of me, but I won't let you!

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:49.240
You too! Instead of doing nothing, think of something!

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.120
Though you say that...

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.000
We can't think of anything!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.550
Don't try to change the subject!

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.670
That's not what we're doing! Dr. Eggman!

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:02.380
Look!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:09.060
It's Sonic's team!

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.480
How dare they copy me!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.400
See what you've done? They'll get the Chaos Emeralds before us!

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.360
I don't need to hear that from you! Still...

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.620
It looks like they don't know what to do either.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.830
That's right!

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.750
Stop saying that it's impossible! We don't know until we try!

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.670
Didn't you just see that meteorite?

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:41.130
If they find us, they'll destroy us in an instant!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:44.170
Hey hey, you two need to cool it.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.800
This is Dr. Eggman.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:51.100
I'd like to make a proposal.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.690
What kind of proposal?

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:57.230
Let's work together this time.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.360
What?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:01.690
What's wrong with you, Dr. Eggman?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:05.740
I see. You're planning to use them as a decoy.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:09.780
This is definitely a trap!

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:13.540
Don't be fooled again, Knuckles!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:15.330
Why are you picking on me?

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:20.210
But we don't have any other choice. Let's accept the trap.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.170
I guess.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.840
Okay! Let's work together, Eggman!

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.300
What's your plan?

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:32.560
Sneak into the fortress using Chaos Control.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:35.770
Oh yeah! We could do that!

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:38.060
Great idea as always, Dr. Eggman!

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:41.730
But that means we don't need to work with them!

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.690
We can do this ourselves!

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.990
"We?" Give me a break.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:51.660
I had to make this roundabout plan because of you!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:59.120
Here's the plan: The first team sneaks into the fortress using Chaos Control and destroys the defense system from inside.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:02.590
Next, the main force charges into the fortress.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:03.750
Sounds good!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.050
What about the Chaos Emeralds?

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.130
Are we each going to take one?

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.550
It'll be first come, first served.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.600
Sure.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:18.190
For the first team, Shadow and Rouge will go from our side.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.600
We want one of you to join this team.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.770
Why me?

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:26.400
You used to be the President's agent.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.410
You're familiar with these kinds of plans.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:30.860
Of course, but…

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:38.620
I get it. He doesn't want me on the main force because he's afraid that I'll steal the Chaos Emerald.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.170
But that's not going to work.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.210
Understood, Doctor.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:48.840
Thanks for understanding, Rouge.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:59.480
I refuse. I don't know what to talk about with Shadow and Rouge.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:02.810
It's not like you're going on a picnic...

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:07.570
I also refuse! I refuse to work with that bat girl!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.110
Why don't we decide by rock-paper-scissors?

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.370
I'll go.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:14.830
You, Chris?

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.370
Yes. Is it okay?

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.660
No problem!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.620
But please be careful, Chris.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.390
Huh? What's this?

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:45.400
I'm giving these limiters back to you.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.230
You don't remember?

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:59.870
Your power goes out-of-control, so you need these limiters to control it.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:06.170
But you removed them during the battle at Space Colony ARK.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.000
I'm Shadow!

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.470
Shadow the Hedgehog!

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.680
I removed them?

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:49.840
With these, you won't lose consciousness during battle.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.550
I see.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:54.170
In that case, I'll take them.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.940
Let's go.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:10.150
Chaos Control!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:26.460
It's a power-up item that increases speed.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:34.760
Wow! We're definitely going to beat Eggman!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.430
We'll see about that.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.140
Why did you come here?

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:46.270
This is a courtesy call.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.400
I didn't know Amy Rose's ship was also here.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:54.110
It's still new, so keep your dirty hands off it!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.030
I'm just looking.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.750
It's well-maintained.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:07.960
I expected nothing less.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.760
Sorry to bother you. See ya!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:27.850
What was that about? Was he spying on us?

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.400
Who knows.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:33.480
This is Chris. We just arrived inside the fortress via Chaos Control.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:38.610
We'll start our search inside the fortress.

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.570
We're counting on you, Chris.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:41.950
You can count on us!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.480
Now!

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:24.030
I have to get away from these two so that I can look for the Chaos Emeralds.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:28.790
Since this place is so huge, shouldn't we split up and look for the Chaos Emeralds?

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:29.660
No.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:30.660
Why not?

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:33.130
I don't want to look for you if you get lost.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:34.290
Oh really.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:39.130
Eggman probably told him to keep an eye on me.

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:45.140
He's on his guard.

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:49.100
In that case, I'll have to get him off his guard.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:56.070
The three of us using Chaos Control is just like when we escaped from Prison Island.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:57.520
You're right!

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.860
I was scared.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:04.320
I thought you were going to abandon me.

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:08.580
We then flew to Space Colony ARK.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:13.170
Yes. ARK was filled with memories of Maria.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:14.420
Maria!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.550
Shadow?

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.930
Wait!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:32.100
The Chaos Emeralds are mine.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.440
Get out of my way!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.720
Stay out of trouble.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.970
Sorry.

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:13.140
Wait! This looks like the control room!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:15.640
Hey!

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:26.280
Just as I thought! If we destroy this, the defense system will be offline!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:50.640
This is Chris! We destroyed the defense system!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.140
You did it, Chris!

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.100
Ready?

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:57.940
Let's go!

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.490
Bye!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.990
Be careful!

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.710
Bye!

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:23.340
What should I do if he finds out?

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:40.690
It looks like this will be a fun race!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:01.210
40 degrees to the right!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.750
All right!

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.220
Fly in there!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.180
Hey!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:20.730
This is dangerous!

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.560
No, it's not! Just leave it to me!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:30.530
Ouch...

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:37.750
I'll chase after you forever, Sonic.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:41.580
Please fly safely!

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.500
Sorry.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:46.000
Where's Eggman?

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.260
He's right behind us.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.340
That's strange. When is he going to launch his trap?

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:05.060
It says "Do Not Enter."

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:06.570
Keep going!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.070
Okay!

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.660
The door!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.410
It's okay! We'll make it!

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.250
Oh yeah?

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:28.340
What's wrong?

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:31.760
I don't know! What's going on?

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:40.020
Take this!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.600
Hello?

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:45.690
Hello?

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.110
What do you want?

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:48.360
Now!

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.440
I'm taking it!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.610
Got it!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:52.950
See you later!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:57.870
We have to get the Chaos Emeralds back!

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.160
I want to, but...

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.080
Oh no!

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:14.050
Amy's ship didn't make it!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:16.090
We'll pick them up on the way back.

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.640
Are you detecting the Chaos Emeralds?

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.100
They're above us!

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.690
Something showed up!

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:30.690
Don't worry.

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:45.120
What's at the bottom?

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:48.670
I have no idea, but we won't survive if we fall.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:19.110
Are the Chaos Emeralds over there?

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:26.460
Sorry, but we're taking the Chaos Emeralds.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:30.460
Hey! If you're going to speed up, then tell me beforehand!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.090
Thanks for all the help.

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:36.720
Click.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:39.050
What are you doing, Sonic?

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:42.260
I don't know! The engine is suddenly out-of-control!

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:46.140
The Chaos Emeralds are above us, so why are you going down?

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.350
Don't ask me!

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:54.480
How's this?

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.110
How's that?

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:59.150
So you're behind this, Dr. Eggman!

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:01.410
Give me that device!

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.240
You're cheating!

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:07.830
I'll do whatever it takes to win!

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.000
How dare you!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.750
Farewell!

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:25.100
Now all the Chaos Emeralds are mine!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.480
Sonic, go after them!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:35.110
Okay!

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.950
Fly!

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:44.870
Goal!

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.410
What?

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.790
Too bad, Eggman.

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.600
We're still alive.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:23.160
I didn't forget what you did, Eggman!

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:28.080
Well, you see...

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:30.290
Goal!

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:33.870
What?

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:45.050
Sonic!

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.970
I'm glad you're okay.

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:56.610
Isn't it wonderful when two separated lovers reunite?

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:09.080
We've now found all the Chaos Emeralds.

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.580
We finally did it.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.620
By the way, what's that?

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:15.920
That's…

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:22.970
That looks incredible. What is it?

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:28.390
Planet Eggs are the life sources of planets.

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:33.980
They're using the power of the Chaos Emeralds to evolve them into highly concentrated crystals.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.650
Why?

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:38.400
Do you want to know?

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:55.160
Long time no see, Sonic the Hedgehog.

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:57.500
You're...

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:00.670
From before...

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:11.850
You know him?

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:14.100
We fought before.

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:20.690
My name is Dark Oak, ruler of the Metarex.

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:54.390
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:54.390
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:54.390
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

